<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0575_T24PC0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You met the weirdo in this city?\rHe ALWAYS braggin’ about his rare\nhomies. He showed me his PC Box\ffor two hours. I cried.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0575_T24PC0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You can’t help showin’ off your homies,\nright?\rI wanna show mine to my homie in Violet.\nHe ain’t answerin’. He blocked me.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0575_T24PC0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The homies at this Block is ROUGH.\rThey’d blow me away in a second.\fLemme give you some advice.\rThe Block Boss run Fightin’ homies.\nPsychic homies mess ’em up.\rOr just hit ’em first. That’s my whole\nlife philosophy.\rAlso, Chuck can’t hear you under the\nwaterfall. Turn it off. He hate that.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0575_T24PC0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! You WON, didn’t you?\nYour face tellin’ me. It’s smug.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0575_T24PC0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? You only got...ONE homie?\nThat’s sad. That’s real sad.\r...\rI know! I’ll give you a TENTACOOL!\rI caught WAY too many. My bathtub full.\nTake it! Go ’head!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0575_T24PC0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got\nthe TENTACOOL!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0575_T24PC0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wanna give the TENTACOOL\na street name? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
</body>
